WEBVTT

1
00:00:19.773 --> 00:00:21.315
much farther is it, Wugg?"

2
00:00:21.755 --> 00:00:26.179
Loro asked, stepping over a small tree trunk lying across the wooded trail.

3
00:00:26.199 --> 00:00:29.942
"I thought you said we wouldn't have to walk very far."

4
00:00:30.822 --> 00:00:32.564
Wugg stopped and turned around.

5
00:00:33.472 --> 00:00:34.713
"The town is just ahead.

6
00:00:35.533 --> 00:00:37.675
And please call me Dad, not Wugg."

7
00:00:38.395 --> 00:00:39.576
He started walking again.

8
00:00:40.557 --> 00:00:41.397
Dara nodded.

9
00:00:41.417 --> 00:00:47.821
"It's exciting to be in our new home, Loro, but we need to remember to try to fit

10
00:00:47.961 --> 00:00:51.704
in." "I know, Mom," Loro said.

11
00:00:51.724 --> 00:00:53.405
"I'm sorry."

12
00:00:54.285 --> 00:00:58.448
Despite the reminder from Wugg and Dara, he felt a shiver of excitement.

13
00:00:59.136 --> 00:01:04.219
They'd been planning this move for so long, it was amazing that the day had finally arrived.

14
00:01:04.919 --> 00:01:08.341
They followed the trail a little farther and then emerged from the woods.

15
00:01:09.082 --> 00:01:11.603
To the left, a cliff dropped off sharply.

16
00:01:12.404 --> 00:01:17.667
To the right, a steep stone slope rose up, blending into the mountain towering above.

17
00:01:18.267 --> 00:01:20.188
In between was a rocky clearing.

18
00:01:21.369 --> 00:01:26.632
The ancient ruin of a stone wall lay just ahead, and beyond that was a tiny village.

19
00:01:27.496 --> 00:01:30.378
A group of houses were nestled into the sloped ground.

20
00:01:31.339 --> 00:01:37.323
Several shops and official buildings stood around a small town square in the flat area near the ruin.

21
00:01:38.104 --> 00:01:40.425
It was midmorning, and nobody was in view.

22
00:01:40.445 --> 00:01:44.388
"It's quieter here than I expected," Wugg said.

23
00:01:44.408 --> 00:01:47.050
"Yes." Dara looked around.

24
00:01:47.070 --> 00:01:48.431
"But that's okay.

25
00:01:48.871 --> 00:01:50.452
We'll be able to—oh, look!

26
00:01:50.973 --> 00:01:51.733
There's someone."

27
00:01:53.054 --> 00:01:55.576
A man holding a broom had just come out of a house.

28
00:01:56.652 --> 00:01:59.574
"Hello there," he said when he spotted the newcomers.

29
00:01:59.594 --> 00:02:01.675
"Are you visiting Stone Wall?"

30
00:02:02.375 --> 00:02:03.216
Dara smiled.

31
00:02:03.236 --> 00:02:06.137
"Actually, we're moving here."

32
00:02:07.118 --> 00:02:11.480
"Really? Hardly anyone moves here," the man said with a chuckle.

33
00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:13.961
"Which part of Magica did you come from?"

34
00:02:15.082 --> 00:02:16.343
Wugg waved his hand.

35
00:02:16.363 --> 00:02:20.064
"Oh, just a little town a couple of zaps from First City.

36
00:02:20.785 --> 00:02:22.266
You've probably never heard of it."

37
00:02:23.666 --> 00:02:26.368
"Most people have never heard of Stone Wall either."

38
00:02:26.816 --> 00:02:27.897
The man chuckled again.

39
00:02:27.917 --> 00:02:30.478
"What made you decide to settle here?"

40
00:02:30.498 --> 00:02:33.879
"We wanted to see someplace new," Wugg said.

41
00:02:33.899 --> 00:02:36.220
"Yes," Dara added.

42
00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:40.362
"And we heard the views in Stone Wall are spectacular."

43
00:02:41.282 --> 00:02:44.884
Loro climbed onto part of the ruined wall for a better look around.

44
00:02:45.664 --> 00:02:50.466
Stone Wall was about halfway up Mount Mystery, the tallest mountain in Magica.

45
00:02:51.346 --> 00:02:55.368
From atop the wall, he could see out over the densely forested foothills.

46
00:02:56.108 --> 00:03:00.109
Beyond lay a vast plain covered with fields, towns, and rivers.

47
00:03:00.129 --> 00:03:03.370
"Any thoughts on where we should create our house?"

48
00:03:03.990 --> 00:03:05.051
Wugg asked the man.

49
00:03:06.011 --> 00:03:09.072
He used his broom to point to an empty area nearby.

50
00:03:09.092 --> 00:03:11.812
"Nobody uses that spot over there.

51
00:03:12.573 --> 00:03:15.573
I'll go and let Mayor Ruxton know we have three new residents."

52
00:03:16.234 --> 00:03:18.614
"Great. Thanks," Dara said.

53
00:03:19.715 --> 00:03:24.276
They waved good-bye, and Loro followed Wugg and Dara over to the empty land.

54
00:03:25.196 --> 00:03:27.277
"Let's join friction," Dara said.

55
00:03:27.297 --> 00:03:31.640
"That way our magic will be strong enough to build everything at once.

56
00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:34.201
I want to get settled right away."

57
00:03:35.442 --> 00:03:38.843
The three of them stood in a circle and rubbed their hands together.

58
00:03:39.644 --> 00:03:41.665
Magic energy sparked around them.

59
00:03:42.565 --> 00:03:43.446
Loro smiled.

60
00:03:43.466 --> 00:03:46.968
"Making magic feels great," he thought.

61
00:03:46.988 --> 00:03:49.529
"Create!" Wugg said.

62
00:03:53.211 --> 00:03:54.852
Instantly a house appeared.

63
00:03:55.660 --> 00:03:57.401
They went inside and looked around.

64
00:03:58.162 --> 00:04:02.025
The place was small but cozy with a few pieces of simple furniture.

65
00:04:02.045 --> 00:04:04.526
"Nice," Loro said.

66
00:04:04.546 --> 00:04:05.987
"Now what?

67
00:04:06.468 --> 00:04:07.989
Should I help you make more stuff?"

68
00:04:09.030 --> 00:04:11.011
"We can finish up here," Dara said.

69
00:04:11.031 --> 00:04:13.793
"You should go out and start making friends."

70
00:04:13.813 --> 00:04:16.515
"Okay. See you later!"

71
00:04:17.536 --> 00:04:18.937
Loro went back outside.

72
00:04:19.777 --> 00:04:21.558
The man with the broom had disappeared.

73
00:04:22.399 --> 00:04:23.400
Everything was quiet.

74
00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:26.782
The only sound was a bird singing nearby.

75
00:04:26.802 --> 00:04:30.625
"I hope I can meet some kids here," Loro thought.

76
00:04:31.566 --> 00:04:33.908
Suddenly a loud sound rang out.

77
00:04:34.548 --> 00:04:35.989
Hee-haw! Hee-haw!

78
00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:39.252
Curious, Loro followed the sound.

79
00:04:40.133 --> 00:04:42.495
It was coming from the forest at the edge of town.

80
00:04:43.155 --> 00:04:44.036
He was surprised.

81
00:04:45.077 --> 00:04:48.179
He, Wugg, and Dara hadn't passed anyone on their way.

82
00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:54.044
Then he spotted a narrow, winding path that was narrower than the other trail.

83
00:04:54.892 --> 00:04:57.633
He followed it until he emerged into a clearing.

84
00:04:58.494 --> 00:05:03.636
A girl around his age was there with a slightly younger boy whose hat was pulled down over

85
00:05:03.676 --> 00:05:04.116
his ears.

86
00:05:04.796 --> 00:05:07.117
A strange-looking creature was standing with them.

87
00:05:08.037 --> 00:05:11.279
It had a gray coat, four legs, and long ears.

88
00:05:11.299 --> 00:05:13.560
"What's that thing?"

89
00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:15.040
Loro blurted out.

90
00:05:15.921 --> 00:05:18.182
The two kids spun around, surprised.

91
00:05:18.202 --> 00:05:20.503
"Hi! Who are you?"

92
00:05:21.003 --> 00:05:21.703
the girl asked.

93
00:05:22.503 --> 00:05:23.604
"I'm Loro.

94
00:05:24.200 --> 00:05:25.661
My family just moved here."

95
00:05:26.501 --> 00:05:27.381
The girl smiled.

96
00:05:27.401 --> 00:05:31.462
"Wow, I can't remember the last time a kid moved to Stone Wall.

97
00:05:32.242 --> 00:05:34.343
Actually, I'm not sure it's ever happened!

98
00:05:34.963 --> 00:05:35.503
I'm Zella.

99
00:05:35.744 --> 00:05:37.064
This is my brother, Raff."

100
00:05:37.084 --> 00:05:39.685
"Nice to meet you, Loro," the boy said.

101
00:05:40.605 --> 00:05:42.446
Zella gestured at the gray animal.

102
00:05:42.466 --> 00:05:44.726
"Oh, and this is Muncher.

103
00:05:45.006 --> 00:05:45.786
He's our donkey."

104
00:05:46.647 --> 00:05:50.088
Muncher let out his loud sound again and glared at Loro.

105
00:05:51.464 --> 00:05:55.865
"He doesn't look very friendly," Loro said uneasily.

106
00:05:56.906 --> 00:05:58.826
Zella laughed and patted the donkey.

107
00:05:58.846 --> 00:06:02.187
"Oh, don't worry about him.

108
00:06:03.247 --> 00:06:05.168
He's not used to new people, that's all.

109
00:06:05.908 --> 00:06:06.748
Where did you move from?"

110
00:06:06.768 --> 00:06:09.909
"Will you two show me around Stone Wall?"

111
00:06:10.469 --> 00:06:11.629
Loro asked quickly.

112
00:06:11.649 --> 00:06:14.130
"My parents and I just arrived.

113
00:06:15.130 --> 00:06:16.631
I haven't seen anything yet."

114
00:06:17.591 --> 00:06:18.391
Zella shrugged.

115
00:06:18.411 --> 00:06:20.852
"There's not much to see.

116
00:06:21.644 --> 00:06:24.045
But sure, we'll give you the grand tour."

117
00:06:24.905 --> 00:06:25.845
She looked at her brother.

118
00:06:25.865 --> 00:06:28.106
"Should we zap back to town?"

119
00:06:28.126 --> 00:06:31.587
"No, let's walk there," Raff said.

120
00:06:31.607 --> 00:06:34.708
"We can show Loro more of the forest on the way."

121
00:06:34.728 --> 00:06:38.809
"Uh-oh," Loro thought, wriggling his toes.

122
00:06:38.829 --> 00:06:41.930
"I've got to do more walking.

123
00:06:42.890 --> 00:06:47.031
These shoes feel so tight, and my feet are already sore."

124
00:06:48.031 --> 00:06:50.432
But he forced himself to smile at the two kids.

125
00:06:51.489 --> 00:06:55.758
"My parents will be happy to hear I'm already making friends," he thought.

126
00:06:55.778 --> 00:07:00.689
"So far everything is going according to our plans!"
